{%- comment -%}
  BBB Trust Seal.

  Rendered from two places, once each, and each call declares which slot it is:

    {% render 'kw-bbb-seal', placement: 'standing' %}   -> sections/kw-footer.liquid
    {% render 'kw-bbb-seal', placement: 'floating' %}   -> layout/theme.liquid

  Only the slot matching Theme settings > Kilowash trust badges > "Seal placement"
  prints anything, so the seal can never appear twice and switching placement is a
  dropdown change, not a code change. "Off" matches neither slot.

  IT RENDERS NOTHING UNTIL A REAL SEAL IS SUPPLIED. There is deliberately no
  placeholder and no fallback graphic: a trust seal that is not the business's own
  issued seal is a fabricated credential, and an empty footer is the correct output
  until someone with BBB account access pastes the real one in.

  Two ways to supply it, in priority order:

  1. PREFERRED — "Seal image" + "BBB profile URL". BBB's static seal. Serves from
     Shopify's CDN, costs no third-party JavaScript, cannot shift layout, and keeps
     the seal working if BBB's script host is slow or blocked. This is the one to use.
  2. FALLBACK — "Seal embed code", for BBB's dynamic JS seal if they insist on it.
     Printed raw and unescaped, which is what an embed needs and why the field is
     admin-only. It loads a third-party script on every page; expect a Lighthouse
     hit and a real CLS risk unless the seal is boxed by CSS.

  The floating variant is pinned bottom-LEFT on purpose. kw-light-switch is fixed
  bottom-right at z-index 500 (assets/kw-theme.css); bottom-right would bury the
  smart-light demo behind the seal on every page. The seal sits at z-index 400 so
  it can never cover the light switch or a cart drawer either.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign slot = placement | default: 'standing'
  assign chosen = settings.kw_bbb_placement | default: 'standing'
  assign seal = settings.kw_bbb_seal_image
  assign profile_url = settings.kw_bbb_profile_url | strip
  assign embed = settings.kw_bbb_seal_embed | strip

  assign alt_text = settings.kw_bbb_alt | strip
  if alt_text == blank
    assign biz = settings.kw_seo_business_name | default: shop.name
    assign alt_text = biz | append: ' — BBB Trust Seal'
  endif
-%}

{%- if chosen == slot -%}
  {%- if seal != blank -%}
    <div class="kw-bbb kw-bbb--{{ slot }}">
      {%- if profile_url != blank -%}
        <a
          class="kw-bbb__link"
          href="{{ profile_url }}"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
      <img
        src="{{ seal | image_url: width: 320 }}"
        alt="{{ alt_text | escape }}"
        width="{{ seal.width }}"
        height="{{ seal.height }}"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
      {%- if profile_url != blank -%}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- elsif embed != blank -%}
    <div class="kw-bbb kw-bbb--{{ slot }} kw-bbb--embed">
      {{ settings.kw_bbb_seal_embed }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if seal != blank or embed != blank -%}
    <style>
      .kw-bbb__link {
        display: inline-block;
        line-height: 0;
      }

      .kw-bbb img {
        display: block;
        height: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .kw-bbb--standing {
        margin-top: 1.4rem;
      }

      .kw-bbb--standing img {
        width: 148px;
      }

      .kw-bbb--floating {
        position: fixed;
        left: clamp(14px, 3vw, 28px);
        bottom: clamp(14px, 3vw, 28px);
        z-index: 400;
      }

      .kw-bbb--floating img {
        width: 116px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .kw-bbb--floating img {
          width: 88px;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
        .kw-bbb__link {
          transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }

        .kw-bbb__link:hover {
          opacity: 0.82;
        }
      }
    </style>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
